\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces (a) Localization by gap. The trained variants are level everywhere except at gaps of 8--12 screens, where the per-screen scorer leads by 21.8 points; at 13 or more both fall below prompted full history. (b) What the free labels buy: the same labels lift both architectures, the scorer twice as much. Numbers are in Tables~\ref {tab:main} and~\ref {tab:gap}.}}{6}{figure.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:results}{{2}{6}{(a) Localization by gap. The trained variants are level everywhere except at gaps of 8--12 screens, where the per-screen scorer leads by 21.8 points; at 13 or more both fall below prompted full history. (b) What the free labels buy: the same labels lift both architectures, the scorer twice as much. Numbers are in Tables~\ref {tab:main} and~\ref {tab:gap}}{figure.caption.15}{}}
